License: CC-BY-NC-4.0
Comment: UNRESOLVED LICENCE: the guardian statues are derived from the Printables model "Persian Lamassu" by Peter Farell (CC BY-NC): a render of it was the
 reference of a Hyper3D Rodin generation, which was decimated and scaled (models-src/lamassu/NOTES.md). CC BY-NC does not fit the CC BY-SA of the rest of the datadisk
 (non-commercial use only). The owner decided to make the derived work; before a release the author must be asked for permission, the statue remade from other material
 or these files left out.

Files: media/world/height.pgm media/world/water.pgm
Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
 2022 National Centers for Environmental Information (NOAA)
License: public-domain and CC-BY-SA-4.0
 The rasters derive from ETOPO 2022 (NOAA National Centers for Environmental
 Information, U.S. government work, public domain); the Early Dynastic shoreline
 of the Persian Gulf and the ancient courses of the Euphrates and Tigris are
 documented reconstructions by the Ishtaria Team (research/WORLD.md). The
 derived rasters are CC-BY-SA-4.0 as the rest of the package.

